# =============================================================================
# Giftgenie site - .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This repository holds only the static site, so there is very little to ignore.
# The site has no build step and no dependencies.
# =============================================================================

# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing here should ever need an environment file. If one appears, stop.
.env
.env.*
!*.env.example

# --- Deployment tooling ------------------------------------------------------
# Created by `vercel link` / `vercel deploy` locally; not part of the source.
.vercel/
.netlify/

# --- Caches / temp -----------------------------------------------------------
.cache/
.tmp/
temp/
tmp/

# --- Editors and IDEs --------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Operating system --------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
